  "details": "The current workaround to let objects from avatars stay static in world space is buggy and doesn't work if you want to make more complex objects, e.g. with added spring joints. It will still be affected by the players movement and just mess everything up. \nPlease add a native support for avatar objects to be parented to world space, at the position at which the avatar enables them.",
